    </div>

    <aside class="sidebar"> <div class="sidebar-header"> <div class="sidebar-header-text"> <h1>Certificate Studio</h1> <p class="sidebar-header-description">Design and print professional certificates in seconds.</p> </div> <button class="theme-toggle-btn" id="theme-toggle" onclick="toggleTheme()" title="Toggle Light/Dark Mode"> <svg id="theme-icon-moon" class="theme-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"> <path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3a7 7 0 0 0 9.79 9.79z"></path> </svg> <svg id="theme-icon-sun" class="theme-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="display:none;"> <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"></circle><line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="3"></line><line x1="12" y1="21" x2="12" y2="23"></line><line x1="4.22" y1="4.22" x2="5.64" y2="5.64"></line><line x1="18.36" y1="18.36" x2="19.78" y2="19.78"></line><line x1="1" y1="12" x2="3" y2="12"></line><line x1="21" y1="12" x2="23" y2="12"></line><line x1="4.22" y1="19.78" x2="5.64" y2="18.36"></line><line x1="18.36" y1="5.64" x2="19.78" y2="4.22"></line> </svg> </button> </div> <div class="scroll-content"> <div class="section"> <div class="section-header"> <h3>Content</h3> </div> <div class="section-body"> <div class="field"> <label class="field-label" for="tag-input">Badge Text</label> <input type="text" id="tag-input" class="input-field" placeholder="e.g. Academy Award" oninput="updatePreview()" value="Academy Award"> </div> <div class="field"> <label class="field-label">Badge Color</label> <div class="color-picker"> <label class="color-swatch" aria-label="Zinc" style="--swatch: #71717a;"> <input type="radio" name="badge-color" value="zinc" checked onchange="setBadgeColor('zinc')"> </label> <label class="color-swatch" aria-label="Red" style="--swatch: #ef4444;"> <input type="radio" name="badge-color" value="red" onchange="setBadgeColor('red')"> </label> <label class="color-swatch" aria-label="Amber" style="--swatch: #f59e0b;"> <input type="radio" name="badge-color" value="amber" onchange="setBadgeColor('amber')"> </label> <label class="color-swatch" aria-label="Green" style="--swatch: #22c55e;"> <input type="radio" name="badge-color" value="green" onchange="setBadgeColor('green')"> </label> <label class="color-swatch" aria-label="Blue" style="--swatch: #3b82f6;"> <input type="radio" name="badge-color" value="blue" onchange="setBadgeColor('blue')"> </label> <label class="color-swatch" aria-label="Purple" style="--swatch: #a855f7;"> <input type="radio" name="badge-color" value="purple" onchange="setBadgeColor('purple')"> </label> <label class="color-swatch" aria-label="Pink" style="--swatch: #ec4899;"> <input type="radio" name="badge-color" value="pink" onchange="setBadgeColor('pink')"> </label> </div> </div> <div class="field"> <label class="field-label" for="title-input">Award Title</label> <input type="text" id="title-input" class="input-field" placeholder="e.g. Certificate of Achievement" oninput="updatePreview()" value="Certificate of Achievement"> </div> <div class="field"> <label class="field-label" for="sub-input">Description</label> <textarea id="sub-input" class="input-field" style="height: 80px; resize: none;" oninput="updatePreview()">For demonstrating exceptional commitment, leadership, and technical skill during the 2026 academy season.</textarea> </div> </div> </div> <div class="section"> <div class="section-header"> <h3>Recipients</h3> </div> <div class="section-body"> <fieldset class="radio-group"> <div class="radio-field"> <input type="radio" name="entry-mode" id="mode-single" value="single" checked onchange="setEntryMode('single')"> <label for="mode-single" class="radio-label">Single</label> <div id="single-name-container" class="radio-nested"> <input type="text" id="recipient-input" class="input-field" placeholder="e.g. Alex Johnson" oninput="updatePreview()" value="Alex Johnson"> </div> </div> <div class="radio-field"> <input type="radio" name="entry-mode" id="mode-batch" value="batch" onchange="setEntryMode('batch')"> <label for="mode-batch" class="radio-label">Batch</label> <div id="batch-names-container" class="radio-nested" style="display: none;"> <textarea id="batch-names-input" class="input-field" style="height: 100px; resize: none;" placeholder="e.g. Alex Johnson, Sam Lee, Jordan Smith" oninput="updatePreview()"></textarea> <p class="field-description">Separate names with commas or new lines.</p> </div> </div> </fieldset> </div> </div> <div class="section"> <div class="section-header"> <h3>Appearance</h3> </div> <div class="section-body"> <div class="field"> <label class="field-label">Design Theme</label> <fieldset class="card-radio-group" aria-label="Choose a design theme"> <div class="card-radio-grid cols-4"> <label class="card-radio" aria-label="Plain"> <input type="radio" name="skin" value="plain" checked onchange="setSkin('plain')"> <span class="card-radio-text">Plain</span> </label> <label class="card-radio" aria-label="Gymnastic"> <input type="radio" name="skin" value="default" onchange="setSkin('default')"> <span class="card-radio-text">Gymnastic</span> </label> <label class="card-radio" aria-label="Dance"> <input type="radio" name="skin" value="dance" onchange="setSkin('dance')"> <span class="card-radio-text">Dance</span> </label> <label class="card-radio" aria-label="Football"> <input type="radio" name="skin" value="football" onchange="setSkin('football')"> <span class="card-radio-text">Football</span> </label> </div> </fieldset> </div> <div class="field"> <label class="field-label">Rank Seal</label> <fieldset class="card-radio-group" aria-label="Choose a rank seal"> <div class="card-radio-grid cols-4"> <label class="card-radio" aria-label="None"> <input type="radio" name="seal" value="none" checked onchange="setSeal('none')"> <span class="card-radio-text">None</span> </label> <label class="card-radio card-radio-gold" aria-label="Gold"> <input type="radio" name="seal" value="gold" onchange="setSeal('gold')"> <span class="card-radio-text">Gold</span> </label> <label class="card-radio card-radio-silver" aria-label="Silver"> <input type="radio" name="seal" value="silver" onchange="setSeal('silver')"> <span class="card-radio-text">Silver</span> </label> <label class="card-radio card-radio-bronze" aria-label="Bronze"> <input type="radio" name="seal" value="bronze" onchange="setSeal('bronze')"> <span class="card-radio-text">Bronze</span> </label> </div> </fieldset> </div> <div class="field"> <label class="field-label">Seal Label Style</label> <div class="listbox" id="seal-label-listbox"> <button type="button" class="listbox-button" onclick="toggleListbox('seal-label-listbox')" aria-haspopup="listbox"> <span class="listbox-selected" id="seal-label-selected">Use Ordinal (1st, 2nd, 3rd)</span> <span class="listbox-chevron"> <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"> <path d="M5.75 10.75L8 13L10.25 10.75"></path> <path d="M10.25 5.25L8 3L5.75 5.25"></path> </svg> </span> </button> <div class="listbox-options" role="listbox"> <div class="listbox-option selected" role="option" data-value="ordinal" onclick="selectListboxOption(this)"> <svg class="listbox-check" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"> <path d="M4 8.5l3 3L12 4"></path> </svg> <span>Use Ordinal (1st, 2nd, 3rd)</span> </div> <div class="listbox-option" role="option" data-value="name" onclick="selectListboxOption(this)"> <svg class="listbox-check" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"> <path d="M4 8.5l3 3L12 4"></path> </svg> <span>Use Names (Gold, Silver, Bronze)</span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="section"> <div class="section-header"> <h3>Your Details</h3> </div> <div class="section-body"> <div class="field"> <label class="field-label">Logo</label> <label for="logo-upload" class="custom-file-upload"> <i class="icon">↑</i> <span id="file-status">Upload Logo...</span> </label> <input type="file" id="logo-upload" class="file-input" accept="image/*" onchange="handleLogoUpload(event)"> </div> <div class="field"> <label class="field-label" for="business-input">Business Name</label> <input type="text" id="business-input" class="input-field" placeholder="e.g. Elite Gymnastics Academy" oninput="updatePreview()" value="Elite Gymnastics Academy"> </div> <div class="field"> <label class="field-label" for="location-input">Location</label> <input type="text" id="location-input" class="input-field" placeholder="e.g. London, UK" oninput="updatePreview()" value="London, UK"> </div> <div class="field"> <label class="field-label" for="coach-input">Your Name</label> <input type="text" id="coach-input" class="input-field" placeholder="e.g. Coach Smith" oninput="updatePreview()" value="Coach Smith"> </div> <div class="field"> <label class="field-label" for="coach-label-input">Title</label> <input type="text" id="coach-label-input" class="input-field" placeholder="e.g. Head Coach" oninput="updatePreview()" value="Head Coach"> </div> <div class="field"> <label class="field-label" for="date-input">Date</label> <input type="text" id="date-input" class="input-field" placeholder="e.g. April 2026" oninput="updatePreview()" value="April 2026"> </div> <input type="hidden" id="date-label-input" value="Date Issued"> <div class="field"> <label class="field-label">Signature / Seal</label> <label for="signature-upload" class="custom-file-upload"> <i class="icon">↑</i> <span id="sig-file-status">Upload Signature...</span> </label> <input type="file" id="signature-upload" class="file-input" accept="image/*" onchange="handleSignatureUpload(event)"> </div> <div class="field"> <label class="field-label" for="website-input">Website</label> <input type="text" id="website-input" class="input-field" placeholder="e.g. www.elitegymnastics.com" oninput="updatePreview()" value="www.elitegymnastics.com"> </div> <div class="field"> <label class="field-label" for="email-input">Email</label> <input type="email" id="email-input" class="input-field" placeholder="e.g. info@elitegymnastics.com" oninput="updatePreview()" value="info@elitegymnastics.com"> </div> <div class="field"> <label class="field-label" for="phone-input">Phone</label> <input type="tel" id="phone-input" class="input-field" placeholder="e.g. +44 20 7946 0958" oninput="updatePreview()" value="+44 20 7946 0958"> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="sidebar-footer"> <div class="footer-actions"> <button class="btn btn-primary" id="download-btn" onclick="handleDownload()" style="width: 100%;">Print Certificate</button> </div> <p class="powered-by">Powered by <a href="https://classcardapp.com/?utm_source=ftl-certificate-generator" target="_blank">Classcard</a> — Automate scheduling & payments.</p> </div> </aside> <div class="resizer" id="sidebar-resizer"></div> <main class="preview-container"> <div id="preview-scaler"> <div id="certificate-preview" class="cert-render-area skin-default"> <img id="preview-bg-layer" class="cert-bg-layer" src="" alt="" style="object-fit: fill;"> <div class="cert-content"> <div class="cert-logo-top"> <img id="preview-logo" src="" alt="Logo"> </div> <div class="cert-tag" id="preview-tag">Academy Award</div> <div id="preview-seal" class="cert-seal seal-none"></div> <h1 class="cert-headline" id="preview-title">Certificate of Achievement</h1> <p class="presented-text">This certificate is proudly presented to</p> <div class="cert-recipient" id="preview-recipient">Alex Johnson</div> <p class="cert-sub" id="preview-sub">For demonstrating exceptional commitment, leadership, and
                        technical skill during the 2026 academy season.</p> <div class="signature-area"> <div class="sig-stamp"> <img id="preview-signature" src="" alt="Signature"> </div> <div class="sig-details"> <p class="sig-name" id="preview-coach">Coach Smith</p> <p class="sig-label" id="preview-coach-label">Head Coach</p> <p class="sig-date" id="preview-date">April 2026</p> </div> </div> <div class="cert-org-info"> <span id="preview-business"></span> <span id="preview-location"></span> </div> </div> <div class="cert-contact-info"> <span id="preview-website"></span> <span id="preview-email"></span> <span id="preview-phone"></span> </div> <p class="cert-generated">Generated on Classcardapp.com</p> </div> </div> <div class="zoom-toolbar desktop-only"> <button onclick="adjustZoom(-0.1)" class="btn btn-outline btn-icon" title="Zoom Out"> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="3" y1="8" x2="13" y2="8"></line></svg> </button> <input type="range" id="preview-zoom-slider" min="0.3" max="1.5" step="0.01" value="0.9" class="zoom-slider" oninput="updateManualScale(this.value)"> <button onclick="adjustZoom(0.1)" class="btn btn-outline btn-icon" title="Zoom In"> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="3" y1="8" x2="13" y2="8"></line><line x1="8" y1="3" x2="8" y2="13"></line></svg> </button> <button onclick="resetZoom()" id="preview-zoom-val" class="btn btn-plain zoom-val">Auto</button> <button onclick="resetZoom()" class="btn btn-outline" title="Reset Zoom">Reset</button> </div> </main>
    <div class="mobile-print">
